    {
      "id": "c1a4b720-f56b-4c3a-aeca-a89f473132f4",
      "name": "Company Overview Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        1020,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a company researcher agent. Goal: extract these fields about a company:\n- year_founded\n- money_raised\n- funding_status\n- employees_count\n- latest_articles (max 3)\n\nCONSTRAINTS:\n- Maximum 3 tool calls total. Stop after 3 calls.\n- Prefer Search Crunchbase first. Use WellFound or LinkedIn only if Crunchbase failed.\n- Do NOT use Webscraper tools.\n- Missing data = empty string or empty array. Never null.\n- Skip retries on 4xx/5xx errors.\n\nCRITICAL OUTPUT RULE:\n- If you cannot find data after 2 tool calls, return the JSON structure with empty/default values.\n- NEVER respond with prose, apologies, or explanations.\n- NEVER say 'I cannot' or 'I apologize'.\n- Empty data = JSON with: numbers=0, strings=\"\", arrays=[], booleans=false.\n- Always use the format_final_json_response tool with valid JSON."
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.6
    },
    {
      "id": "1070c7f0-544a-478b-bd97-df8f2c0d79fa",
